:PNLGRP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP   NAME=LSTOBJ.List Objects in Library with Sizes (LSTOBJ)
:P.This command is used create and email an excel file of all objects
in the selscted library or library list.
:EHELP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP   NAME='LSTOBJ/LIBRARY'.Library - Help
:XH3.LIBRARY - Library
:P.This is the name of the library to list the objects for. It allows
the following special values.
:ul.
:li.*LIBL - List all libraries in the current jobs library list.
:li.*ALLUSR - List all user libraries on the system.
:li.*ALL - List all libraries on the system.
:eul.
:p.This is a required parameter.
:EHELP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP   NAME='LSTOBJ/EMAILTO'.Email To - Help
:XH3.EMAILTO - Email To
:P.This is email address the report will be sent to.
:p.This is a required parameter.
:EHELP.
.*---------------------------------------------------------------------
:EPNLGRP.
